<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Industrial six-mth net loss.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Industrial six-mth net loss.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		  18.83	 vs     profit   12.34</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents) loss 3.7	  vs     profit    2.4</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,036.40	 vs	     1,195.43</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  80.40	 vs		  80.65</p>
<p>    Minorities loss	 54.73	 vs    loss	35.06</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries loss 112.24	 vs    gain	50.18</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)     1.0	  vs		   4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Berjaya Industrial Bhd. It is involved in property investment and development as well as operating hotels and resorts.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
